      "text": "how to ensure always available and fault tolerance\n    First things to be consider is replication  Data should be copied in multiple nodes with replication factor.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how to ensure always available and fault tolerance\n    First things to be consider is replication  Data should be copied in multiple nodes with replication factor.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ce92Bk6xswZWY8Yw9l7-f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -19.432952352193297,
      "y": 4387.171082538994,
      "width": 457.6476135253906,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
